# Review usage, canonical reports, and immutable run archives are durable
# repository history. Monthly ledgers, .quality/reports/runs/*.json, and
# .quality/run-history are intentionally committed; only the
# resumable orchestration state under .quality/runs is ignored.
!/.quality/
!/.quality/usage/
!/.quality/usage/*.jsonl
!/.quality/run-history/
!/.quality/run-history/**
